WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.834
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:05.167
You're here. Thank you.
You made it.

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:08.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:10.434
Well, guys,
here's some good news.

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:12.934
New York City has lowered
the COVID alert level

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:15.067
from high to medium.

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:18.767
Yes.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:22.167
Finally, the 100 people crammed
into every subway car

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:23.968
won't have to be so careful
anymore.

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:27.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.167 --> 00:00:29.400
Yeah, I'm excited because if it
drops one more level,

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.701
the most dangerous thing will
once again be the hot dogs.

00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:34.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:37.167
I want to be the person who gets
to decide the level, by the way.

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:38.400
They're probably like,

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.667
"Well, it's my birthday party
this weekend.

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:42.234
I want people to come.
So, medium it is, medium."

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:43.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.067
"My cousin's wedding
is next weekend.

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:47.033
Back up to high!"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:49.434
"Everyone lock down."

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:50.634
And this is big.

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:52.400
The FDA just announced
that they are banning

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.100
all Juul e-cigarettes
in the U.S.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.334
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:57.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.901 --> 00:01:00.100
Yeah.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.834
No more Juul. No more Juul.

00:01:02.834 --> 00:01:04.367
That'll explain tomorrow
when you see a bunch of

00:01:04.367 --> 00:01:06.467
your coworkers sucking on
a Glade plug-in.

00:01:06.467 --> 00:01:09.467
It's like, "You getting
anything? You getting anything?"

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:10.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:12.467
"I feel -- I'm feeling a little
something. I don't know."

00:01:12.467 --> 00:01:13.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:15.968
It's a big deal because
if they also ban fedoras,

00:01:15.968 --> 00:01:17.334
your old college roommate
is going to

00:01:17.334 --> 00:01:18.434
have a nervous breakdown.

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:19.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.968 --> 00:01:21.634
Meanwhile, the Biden
administration says

00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:24.133
they're moving forward with
a plan to eliminate nearly

00:01:24.133 --> 00:01:26.567
all nicotine in cigarettes.

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:29.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:32.000
Man.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.868
Man, it's a tough day
for everyone

00:01:33.868 --> 00:01:36.701
who loves ingesting chemicals.
You know what I'm saying?

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:38.100
Can't even huff gas anymore.
It's too expensive.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:42.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:45.367
Speaking of Biden, yesterday, he
visited a vaccine clinic that

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:47.567
was giving out shots to kids
under five.

00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:49.067
And he actually had some
pretty interesting things

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:51.334
