We actually got audio of it.

00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:53.033
-Really?
-Yeah. Take a listen to this.

00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:05.634
[ Laughter ]
It's just a weird thing.

00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:08.367
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Really?

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:10.067
-That's not --
-That's not all you have?

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:11.267
-That's not all he said.
-You have more?

00:02:11.267 --> 00:02:12.801
-Yeah, we have more.
Check this out.

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:31.200
[ Applause ]

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.801
People are like, "What is he --"
-Rhubarb?

00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:37.067
-Yeah, I mean --
Finally, he said this.

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:51.467
Yeah, it's just interesting.
I don't know.

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:53.567
The baby had no idea
what he's talking about.

00:02:53.567 --> 00:02:55.167
Hey, guys, get this.
This is real.

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:58.767
I read a new report that said
Jacuzzis can actually be hacked

00:02:58.767 --> 00:03:01.734
and controlled by other people
remotely.

00:03:01.734 --> 00:03:04.567
So, the next time you're
relaxing in a Jacuzzi,

00:03:04.567 --> 00:03:07.234
remember that the Russians can
boil you like a lobster.

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:11.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:12.801
Hacking a Jacuzzi.

00:03:12.801 --> 00:03:14.334
Apparently, all the hackers met
up like,

00:03:14.334 --> 00:03:17.200
"I'll take credit cards."
"I'll take bank accounts."

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.767
"I'll take Jacuzzis."

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:20.734
[ Laughter ]
What?

00:03:20.734 --> 00:03:22.734
-Bubbles high.
-Yeah.

00:03:22.734 --> 00:03:24.334
If you end up getting hacked,
don't worry.

00:03:24.334 --> 00:03:26.400
It's still not the worst virus
your Jacuzzi has,

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:28.200
so don't worry about it.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:31.734
Yeah. Not you. Not your Jacuzzi.

00:03:31.734 --> 00:03:32.901
Everyone else's Jacuzzi.

00:03:32.901 --> 00:03:35.133
[ Laughter ]
Hey, did you guys see this?

00:03:35.133 --> 00:03:38.400
Apparently, The Ohio State
University has successfully

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.300
trademarked the word "the."

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.234 --> 00:03:45.367
Yeah. And in a related story,
we're now "Le Tonight Show."

00:03:45.367 --> 00:03:47.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.534
We have to.

00:03:48.534 --> 00:03:49.934
