[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:18.901 --> 00:07:21.400
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.701
-Don't encourage it.
Don't encourage it.

00:07:25.901 --> 00:07:27.400
-I'm so sorry, Tariq.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:30.501
I just wish I could do something
to cheer you up.

00:07:30.501 --> 00:07:33.868
-Whatever. I'll just hang out at
